    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/0/04/Scintilla_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250406140249\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Scintilla Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/0/04/Scintilla_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250406140249\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"931\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Scintilla Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Scintilla_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>迅影影刃</b>\n</p><p>一位以刀刃为腿的美丽战士。她的真实形态是东方一座神社中被供奉的狐狸。她通过魔法将双腿化为利刃，以疾风般的速度和鬼火般的步伐迷惑对手。\n\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/0/01/Scintilla_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20250406140250\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Scintilla S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/0/01/Scintilla_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20250406140250\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"996\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Scintilla S Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Scintilla_S_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820070552\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion